{# =========================================================
   RoomHive — Booking Details (guest side)
   templates/booking/details.html.twig

   1:1 port of legacy booking/booking-details.php — the page a
   booking row opens from My Bookings (/bookings → /booking/{id}),
   the legacy URL /booking/details/{id} also routes here (both
   names live on BookingController), and it is the page
   /listings/{id}/payment?pay_balance=N bounces back to once the
   balance is settled.

   Layout (matched against the live legacy screenshot):
     Card 1 — amber "Application pending — {host} has 24 hours…"
              banner (pending only) · cover + title + location pin
              + status pill + payment label · 4 grey boxes (CHECK-IN /
              CHECK-OUT / GUESTS / BOOKED ON) · divider · host row
              (avatar, name, "Your host for this stay", MESSAGE HOST).
     Card 2 — Payment Summary: Booking Total · dotted rule · Amount
              Paid · progress bar + "{n}% of the booking is paid" ·
              Remaining Balance (amber, big) — or Refunded to Wallet
              (green) on cancelled/rejected bookings · PAY BALANCE
              ₱n (dark) + BACK TO MY BOOKINGS (amber outline) +
              CANCEL MY BOOKING (red, pending or confirmed) and
              the amber "(!) Cannot be undone" warning chip —
              THIS VERSION: exactly ONE cancel button on the
              page (the old duplicate CANCEL BOOKING zone under
              the second dotted rule is removed per request).

   Buttons:
     PAY BALANCE        → /listings/{listing}/payment?pay_balance={id}
                          (the balance mode the payment page +
                          payments history already use)
     BACK TO MY BOOKINGS→ /bookings
     MESSAGE HOST       → /messages
     Payment History    → /payments
     CANCEL MY BOOKING  → POST /booking/cancel-booking
                          (BookingCancelController — copy BOTH files
                          together; JS confirm guards the click)

   WISHLIST HEART (top-right of the cover):
     glass circle + heart icon · click → red fill + pulsing glow
     (= saved to wishlist) · click again → glow off (= removed).
     Initial glow state comes from the `wished` variable
     BookingController feeds (SELECT on the legacy `wishlist` table,
     unique key uq_user_listing). Every click POSTs listing_id to
     the SAME /wishlist/toggle endpoint the My Wishlist page remove
     buttons use — response shape {ok, added} or {ok, saved} both
     accepted. Optimistic UI: the glow flips instantly on click,
     then snaps to the server's answer (or reverts if not ok).

   REVIEW BOX — "rate your stay" overlay (this version):
     Pops up as a screen overlay when the stay is FINISHED (status
     completed — first visit, unless previously skipped) or the
     guest JUST cancelled (?review=1 on the redirect from
     BookingCancelController), and only while the guest hasn't
     reviewed the listing yet. Layout 1:1 to the request:
       X (top-right)  — closes the box if the user doesn't want to
         rate; the skip is remembered in the session
         (POST /reviews/dismiss) so a completed stay is never nagged
         twice; the amber "RATE YOUR STAY" button on the page
         re-opens it any time. Backdrop click + ESC close too.
       Upper          — 5 big stars, click to rate (hover previews,
         labels Terrible → Excellent), submit unlocks on the first
         star.
       Lower          — comment textarea (optional, 1000-char cap).
       SUBMIT REVIEW  → POST /reviews/submit (ReviewSubmitController)
         → thanks panel → box auto-closes and the strip flips into
         the green "You rated this stay" row.
     The saved review shows on BOTH profiles automatically — the
     guest's /reviews page (user/reviews.html.twig) and the host's
     /host/reviews page (plus the host public profile + the listing
     page stars) — every one of them reads the same legacy
     `reviews` table, so no extra wiring is needed.

   Data from BookingController (b.*, listing_*, cover*, host_,
   wished, review_open, show_review, already_reviewed, my_review,
   is_host, nav_avatar, notification_count). THIS VERSION
   PAIRS WITH BookingController.php + BookingCancelController.php +
   ReviewSubmitController.php — copy ALL FOUR files together.

   Styles are page-local on the established shell pattern (navbar +
   sidebar partials, sidebar highlight 'bookings'), so myaccount.css
   can never drift the layout. Dark-mode variants included.
========================================================= #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>Booking Details · RoomHive</title>

        <script>
            /* theme boot — before paint */
            (function () {
                try {
                    if (localStorage.getItem("roomhive_theme") === "dark") {
                        document.documentElement.classList.add("dark");
                        document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", "dark");
                    }
                } catch (e) {}
            })();
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/myaccount.css') }}">

        <style>
            :root {
                --rh-ink: #1c2a38;
                --rh-muted: #66788a;
                --rh-line: #e6ebf1;
                --rh-card: #ffffff;
                --rh-accent: #eda423;
                --rh-radius: 16px;
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                           NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof
                                           Same geometry as the bookings page: main.up-dashboard
                                           wins on specificity, the clearance is PADDING (110px),
                                           the middle column drops another 75px, the sticky rail
                                           sits on the 110px line.
                                    ========================================================== */
            main.up-dashboard {
                margin-top: 0;
                padding: 110px 20px 70px;
                max-width: 1560px;
            }

            .up-dashboard .up-content {
                padding-top: 75px;
            }

            .up-dashboard .up-sidebar {
                top: 110px;
            }

            .nav-bell svg {
                width: 22px;
                height: 22px;
                display: block;
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                           CARD 1 — BOOKING OVERVIEW
                                    ========================================================== */
            main.up-dashboard .bd-overview {
                padding: 24px 26px;
            }

            /* amber pending banner */
            .bd-banner {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 11px;
                background: #fdf6e7;
                border: 1px solid #f3d9a4;
                border-radius: 10px;
                padding: 13px 18px;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }
            .bd-banner svg {
                width: 17px;
                height: 17px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                margin-top: 1px;
                color: #b07a1e;
            }
            .bd-banner p {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 13.5px;
                font-weight: 600;
                line-height: 1.5;
                color: #8a5a00;
            }

            /* cover + title block */
            .bd-header {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 20px;
            }
            .bd-cover {
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                width: 170px;
                height: 112px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe6ee, #c9d4e0);
                color: #93a5b7;
            }
            .bd-cover svg {
                width: 26px;
                height: 26px;
            }
            .bd-cover img {
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
            }

            .bd-head-info {
                flex: 1 1 auto;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .bd-head-info h1 {
                margin: 2px 0 7px;
                font-size: 25px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                line-height: 1.2;
                overflow-wrap: anywhere;
            }
            .bd-location {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 13.5px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .bd-location svg {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

            /* status pill + payment label */
            .bd-pills {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 12px;
                margin-top: 12px;
            }
            .up-status {
                display: inline-block;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                padding: 3px 9px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                text-transform: capitalize;
            }
            .up-status-pending {
                background: #fff6e6;
                color: #8a5a00;
            }
            .up-status-confirmed,
            .up-status-completed {
                background: #e8f7ef;
                color: #14683e;
            }
            .up-status-cancelled {
                background: #fdecec;
                color: #a33a3a;
            }
            .up-status-rejected {
                background: #fdecea;
                color: #a1332e;
            }
            .up-status-other {
                background: #eef1f5;
                color: #5b6b7c;
            }
            .bd-pay-label {
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }

            /* the four grey info boxes */
            .bd-boxes {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
                gap: 16px;
                margin-top: 22px;
            }
            .bd-box {
                background: #f4f6fa;
                border: 1px solid #e9edf3;
                border-radius: 12px;
                padding: 13px 18px;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 4px;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .bd-box-label {
                font-size: 10.5px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 0.8px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: #8b95a8;
            }
            .bd-box-value {
                font-size: 15px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                white-space: nowrap;
                overflow: hidden;
                text-overflow: ellipsis;
            }

            /* host row */
            .bd-host {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 14px;
                margin-top: 22px;
                padding-top: 20px;
                border-top: 1px solid #eef1f5;
            }
            .bd-host-avatar {
                width: 42px;
                height: 42px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                object-fit: cover;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                background: #e6ebf1;
            }
            .bd-host-info {
                flex: 1 1 auto;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .bd-host-info h4 {
                margin: 0 0 2px;
                font-size: 14.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .bd-host-info p {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                           BUTTONS — shared shapes
                                    ========================================================== */
            .bd-btn-dark,
            .bd-btn-amber,
            .bd-btn-red {
                display: inline-block;
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 0.8px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 10px;
                padding: 13px 24px;
                cursor: pointer;
                font-family: inherit;
                line-height: 1;
                transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
            }
            .bd-btn-dark {
                background: #1e2a38;
                border: 1.5px solid #1e2a38;
                color: #ffffff;
            }
            .bd-btn-dark:hover {
                background: #2a3a4d;
            }
            .bd-btn-amber {
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1.5px solid var(--rh-accent);
                color: #e09612;
            }
            .bd-btn-amber:hover {
                background: #fff8ec;
            }
            .bd-btn-red {
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 1.5px solid #e35d5d;
                color: #c0392b;
            }
            .bd-btn-red:hover {
                background: #fdf1f0;
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                           CARD 2 — PAYMENT SUMMARY
                                    ========================================================== */
            main.up-dashboard .bd-paycard {
                padding: 24px 26px;
            }

            .bd-pay-header {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 12px;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }
            .bd-pay-header h3 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 17px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .bd-pay-history {
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: #e09612;
                text-decoration: none;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }
            .bd-pay-history:hover {
                text-decoration: underline;
            }

            .bd-row {
                display: flex;
                align-items: baseline;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 12px;
                margin-top: 14px;
            }
            .bd-row-label {
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .bd-row-muted {
                font-weight: 500;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .bd-row-value {
                font-size: 15px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                white-space: nowrap;
            }
            .bd-row-medium {
                font-size: 14.5px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            .bd-divider-dotted {
                border-top: 1.5px dotted #dfe3ea;
                margin: 16px 0 2px;
            }

            /* progress bar */
            .bd-progress {
                margin-top: 16px;
            }
            .bd-progress-track {
                height: 8px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: #e9e9ee;
                overflow: hidden;
            }
            .bd-progress-fill {
                height: 100%;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f6b94d, #ef9d0e);
            }
            .bd-progress-caption {
                margin: 7px 0 0;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }

            /* remaining balance — the big amber figure */
            .bd-remaining-value {
                font-size: 20px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: #dd8f00;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }

            /* refunded to wallet — green row on cancelled/rejected */
            .bd-refund-amount {
                color: #1e7a3d;
            }

            /* action buttons */
            .bd-actions {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 12px;
                margin-top: 24px;
            }

            /* CANCEL MY BOOKING -- header row (right of BACK TO MY
               BOOKINGS): the form wraps the red button, the amber
               chip beside it carries the standing warning. Dark-mode
               chip included; the button itself reuses .bd-btn-red
               (light + dark styles above). */
            .bd-actions form {
                margin: 0;
                display: inline-block;
            }
            .bd-cancel-warning {
                font-size: 11.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #b06d00;
                background: #fff6e9;
                border: 1px dashed #f0c987;
                border-radius: 999px;
                padding: 4px 12px;
            }
            html.dark .bd-cancel-warning {
                color: #e5a94e;
                background: rgba(229, 169, 78, 0.10);
                border-color: rgba(229, 169, 78, 0.35);
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                           RESPONSIVE
                                    ========================================================== */
            @media (max-width: 860px) {
                .up-dashboard {
                    flex-direction: column;
                }
            }
            @media (max-width: 760px) {
                .bd-boxes {
                    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                }
                .bd-header {
                    flex-direction: column;
                }
                .bd-cover {
                    width: 100%;
                    height: 170px;
                }
            }
            @media (max-width: 480px) {
                .bd-boxes {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
                .bd-btn-dark,
                .bd-btn-amber,
                .bd-btn-red {
                    width: 100%;
                    text-align: center;
                }
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                           DARK MODE — same mechanism as
                                           the bookings / payments pages
                                    ========================================================== */
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .bd-overview,
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .bd-paycard {
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .bd-banner {
                background: rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.10);
                border-color: rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.35);
            }
            html.dark .bd-banner p {
                color: #f0c368;
            }
            html.dark .bd-banner svg {
                color: #f0c368;
            }
            html.dark .bd-head-info h1,
            html.dark .bd-row-label,
            html.dark .bd-row-value,
            html.dark .bd-pay-header h3,
            html.dark .bd-host-info h4,
            html.dark .bd-pay-label {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .bd-location,
            html.dark .bd-host-info p,
            html.dark .bd-progress-caption,
            html.dark .bd-row-muted {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .bd-cover {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #26333f, #1c2a38);
                color: #5f7488;
            }
            html.dark .bd-box {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .bd-box-label {
                color: #8fa1b3;
            }
            html.dark .bd-box-value {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .bd-host {
                border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .bd-divider-dotted {
                border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
            }
            html.dark .bd-progress-track {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
            }
            html.dark .bd-btn-amber,
            html.dark .bd-btn-red {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            }

            /* =========== wishlist heart — top-right of the cover ===========
               glass circle · red fill + pulsing glow when saved (.is-active)
               · one-shot pop on every click (.is-popping) */
            .bd-heart-btn {
                position: absolute;
                top: 8px;
                right: 8px;
                z-index: 3;
                width: 32px;
                height: 32px;
                border: 0;
                border-radius: 50%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.45);
                -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
                backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
                color: #ffffff;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.28);
                transition:
                    transform 0.18s ease,
                    background 0.2s ease;
            }
            .bd-heart-btn svg {
                width: 17px;
                height: 17px;
            }
            .bd-heart-btn:hover {
                transform: scale(1.12);
            }
            .bd-heart-btn:active {
                transform: scale(0.9);
            }

            /* GLowing (saved) state — red fill + pulsing glow ring.
               fill: currentColor overrides lucide's fill="none" so the
               heart paints solid white on the red circle. */
            .bd-heart-btn.is-active {
                background: #e5484d;
                animation: bd-heart-glow 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
            }
            .bd-heart-btn.is-active svg {
                fill: currentColor;
            }

            @keyframes bd-heart-glow {
                0%, 100% {
                    box-shadow:
                        0 0 0 0 rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.30),
                        0 0 10px 2px rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.45);
                }
                50% {
                    box-shadow:
                        0 0 0 5px rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.12),
                        0 0 22px 6px rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.65);
                }
            }

            /* one-shot pop on every click (the svg animates so the
               glow loop on the button never restarts) */
            .bd-heart-btn.is-popping svg {
                animation: bd-heart-pop 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.6, 0.4, 1);
            }
            @keyframes bd-heart-pop {
                0% { transform: scale(0.4); }
                55% { transform: scale(1.4); }
                100% { transform: scale(1); }
            }

            html.dark .bd-heart-btn {
                background: rgba(10, 15, 22, 0.55);
            }
            html.dark .bd-heart-btn.is-active {
                background: #e5484d;
            }

            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .bd-heart-btn,
                .bd-heart-btn svg {
                    transition: none;
                    animation: none;
                }
                .bd-heart-btn.is-active {
                    box-shadow: 0 0 14px 3px rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.55);
                }
            }

            /* =========== REVIEW STRIP — under the host row ===========
               amber "RATE YOUR STAY" button + hint, or the green
               done-row once the guest has rated the stay */
            .bd-review-strip {
                margin-top: 18px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 12px;
            }
            .bd-review-strip .bd-btn-amber svg {
                width: 15px;
                height: 15px;
            }
            .bd-review-hint {
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .bd-review-done {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 10px;
                width: 100%;
                font-size: 13.5px;
                color: #1e7a3d;
                background: rgba(30, 122, 61, 0.08);
                border: 1px solid rgba(30, 122, 61, 0.25);
                border-radius: 12px;
                padding: 10px 14px;
            }
            .bd-review-done svg {
                width: 17px;
                height: 17px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .bd-review-done strong {
                font-weight: 800;
            }
            .bd-review-done a {
                margin-left: auto;
                color: #1e7a3d;
                font-weight: 800;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                letter-spacing: 0.6px;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(30, 122, 61, 0.4);
                padding-bottom: 1px;
            }
            .bd-review-done a:hover {
                opacity: 0.75;
            }

            /* =========== REVIEW BOX — the pop-up overlay =========== */
            .bd-review-overlay {
                position: fixed;
                inset: 0;
                z-index: 2000;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 24px;
                background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
                -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
                backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
                opacity: 0;
                visibility: hidden;
                transition:
                    opacity 0.22s ease,
                    visibility 0.22s ease;
            }
            .bd-review-overlay.is-open {
                opacity: 1;
                visibility: visible;
            }
            .bd-review-modal {
                position: relative;
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 430px;
                max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
                overflow-y: auto;
                background: var(--rh-card);
                border: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
                border-radius: 18px;
                box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35);
                padding: 26px 26px 24px;
                transform: translateY(14px) scale(0.97);
                transition: transform 0.26s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.2, 0.4, 1);
            }
            .bd-review-overlay.is-open .bd-review-modal {
                transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
            }

            /* X — upper side, the "don't want to rate" exit */
            .bd-review-close {
                position: absolute;
                top: 14px;
                right: 14px;
                width: 32px;
                height: 32px;
                border: 0;
                border-radius: 50%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                background: transparent;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                transition:
                    background 0.18s ease,
                    color 0.18s ease,
                    transform 0.18s ease;
            }
            .bd-review-close svg {
                width: 18px;
                height: 18px;
            }
            .bd-review-close:hover {
                background: rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.08);
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                transform: rotate(90deg);
            }

            .bd-review-kicker {
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 1.2px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                margin: 0 0 6px;
                padding-right: 40px;
            }
            .bd-review-title {
                font-size: 21px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                margin: 0 0 6px;
            }
            .bd-review-sub {
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 1.5;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                margin: 0 0 16px;
            }

            /* upper — the 5 clickable stars */
            .bd-review-stars {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 10px;
                margin: 4px 0 8px;
            }
            .bd-star {
                width: 44px;
                height: 44px;
                border: 0;
                padding: 0;
                background: transparent;
                cursor: pointer;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                border-radius: 10px;
                transition: transform 0.16s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.4, 0.4, 1);
            }
            .bd-star svg {
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                fill: rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.10);
                stroke: rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.30);
                stroke-width: 1.6;
                stroke-linejoin: round;
                transition:
                    fill 0.15s ease,
                    stroke 0.15s ease;
            }
            .bd-star:hover {
                transform: scale(1.18);
            }
            .bd-star:active {
                transform: scale(0.92);
            }
            .bd-star.is-lit svg {
                fill: #eda423;
                stroke: #d98c12;
            }
            .bd-star:focus-visible {
                outline: 2px solid #eda423;
                outline-offset: 2px;
            }
            .bd-review-star-label {
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                margin: 0 0 16px;
                min-height: 16px;
            }
            .bd-review-star-label.has-value {
                color: #d98c12;
            }

            /* lower — the comment */
            .bd-review-comment {
                width: 100%;
                min-height: 96px;
                resize: vertical;
                border: 1.5px solid var(--rh-line);
                border-radius: 12px;
                background: #f8fafc;
                padding: 12px 14px;
                font: inherit;
                font-size: 13.5px;
                line-height: 1.5;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                outline: none;
                transition:
                    border-color 0.18s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.18s ease,
                    background 0.18s ease;
            }
            .bd-review-comment:focus {
                border-color: #eda423;
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.18);
                background: #ffffff;
            }

            .bd-review-actions {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: flex-end;
                gap: 10px;
                margin-top: 16px;
            }
            .bd-review-skip {
                border: 0;
                background: transparent;
                font: inherit;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                cursor: pointer;
                padding: 9px 12px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                transition:
                    background 0.18s ease,
                    color 0.18s ease;
            }
            .bd-review-skip:hover {
                background: rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.06);
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .bd-review-submit {
                border: 0;
                cursor: pointer;
                font: inherit;
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 0.8px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: #ffffff;
                background: var(--rh-ink);
                padding: 12px 20px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                line-height: 1;
                transition:
                    opacity 0.18s ease,
                    transform 0.18s ease;
            }
            .bd-review-submit:hover {
                transform: translateY(-1px);
            }
            .bd-review-submit:disabled {
                opacity: 0.45;
                cursor: not-allowed;
                transform: none;
            }
            .bd-review-error {
                margin: 10px 0 0;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: #c0292e;
                text-align: center;
            }

            /* thanks panel — swaps in after a successful submit */
            .bd-review-thanks {
                text-align: center;
                padding: 18px 4px 6px;
            }
            .bd-review-thanks svg {
                width: 46px;
                height: 46px;
                color: #1e7a3d;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }
            .bd-review-thanks h4 {
                font-size: 18px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                margin: 0 0 6px;
            }
            .bd-review-thanks p {
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 1.55;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                margin: 0;
            }

            html.dark .bd-review-overlay {
                background: rgba(4, 8, 14, 0.66);
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-modal {
                background: #1a222b;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-title,
            html.dark .bd-review-thanks h4 {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-kicker,
            html.dark .bd-review-sub,
            html.dark .bd-review-star-label,
            html.dark .bd-review-thanks p,
            html.dark .bd-review-hint {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-star-label.has-value {
                color: #f0c368;
            }
            html.dark .bd-star svg {
                fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
                stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
            }
            html.dark .bd-star.is-lit svg {
                fill: #eda423;
                stroke: #f0c368;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-comment {
                background: #12181f;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-comment:focus {
                background: #12181f;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-close {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-close:hover {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-skip:hover {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-submit {
                background: #eda423;
                color: #1c2a38;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-done {
                background: rgba(30, 122, 61, 0.14);
                border-color: rgba(30, 122, 61, 0.40);
                color: #6fd694;
            }
            html.dark .bd-review-done a {
                color: #6fd694;
                border-bottom-color: rgba(111, 214, 148, 0.4);
            }

            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .bd-review-overlay,
                .bd-review-modal,
                .bd-review-close,
                .bd-star,
                .bd-star svg {
                    transition: none;
                }
            }

            @media (max-width: 480px) {
                .bd-review-stars {
                    gap: 6px;
                }
                .bd-star {
                    width: 40px;
                    height: 40px;
                }
                .bd-star svg {
                    width: 30px;
                    height: 30px;
                }
                .bd-review-actions {
                    flex-direction: column-reverse;
                }
                .bd-review-submit {
                    width: 100%;
                }
            }

            /* sidebar markup + styles live in templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig */
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>

        {{ include('partials/navbar.html.twig', {
            is_logged_in: true,
            is_host: is_host ?? false,
            nav_avatar: nav_avatar ?? null,
            notification_count: notification_count ?? 0,
            current_page: 'bookings'
        }) }}

        <main class="up-dashboard">

            <!-- ==================================================
                 SIDEBAR — shared partial (templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig)
                 highlight = active_sidebar key · collapse JS stays on this page
            =================================================== -->
            {% include 'partials/sidebar.html.twig' with { active_sidebar: 'bookings' } %}

            <div class="up-content">

                <!-- ==============================================
                     CARD 1 — booking overview
                =============================================== -->
                <section class="up-card bd-overview up-reveal">

                    {% if b.status == 'pending' %}
                        <div class="bd-banner">
                            <i data-lucide="hourglass"></i>
                            <p>Application pending — {{ host_name }} has 24 hours to respond before it is auto-declined and the reserve is refunded in full.</p>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}

                    <div class="bd-header">
                        <div class="bd-cover">
                            {% if cover %}
                                <img
                                    src="{{ cover_url }}"
                                    alt="{{ listing_title }}"
                                    onerror="this.remove();"
                                >
                            {% endif %}
                            <i data-lucide="home"></i>
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                id="bdWishlistHeart"
                                class="bd-heart-btn{{ wished ? ' is-active' : '' }}"
                                data-listing-id="{{ b.listing_id }}"
                                aria-pressed="{{ wished ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
                                aria-label="{{ wished ? 'Remove from wishlist' : 'Save to wishlist' }}"
                                title="{{ wished ? 'Remove from wishlist' : 'Save to wishlist' }}"
                            >
                                <i data-lucide="heart"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bd-head-info">
                            <h1>{{ listing_title }}</h1>
                            <p class="bd-location"><i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>{{ listing_location }}</p>
                            <div class="bd-pills">
                                <span class="up-status up-status-{{ b.status in ['pending','confirmed','completed','cancelled','rejected'] ? b.status : 'other' }}">{{ b.status|capitalize }}</span>
                                {% if b.payment_label %}
                                    <span class="bd-pay-label">{{ b.payment_label }}</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bd-boxes">
                        <div class="bd-box">
                            <span class="bd-box-label">Check-In</span>
                            <span class="bd-box-value">{{ b.checkin_fmt }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bd-box">
                            <span class="bd-box-label">Check-Out</span>
                            <span class="bd-box-value">{{ b.checkout_fmt }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bd-box">
                            <span class="bd-box-label">Guests</span>
                            <span class="bd-box-value">{{ b.guests }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bd-box">
                            <span class="bd-box-label">Booked On</span>
                            <span class="bd-box-value">{{ b.booked_fmt }}</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bd-host">
                        <img
                            class="bd-host-avatar"
                            src="{{ host_avatar }}"
                            alt="{{ host_name }}"
                            onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/default-avatar.png';"
                        >
                        <div class="bd-host-info">
                            <h4>{{ host_name }}</h4>
                            <p>Your host for this stay</p>
                        </div>
                        <a class="bd-btn-amber" href="/messages">MESSAGE HOST</a>
                    </div>

                    {% if b.status in ['completed', 'cancelled'] and (show_review or already_reviewed) %}
                        <div class="bd-review-strip" id="bdReviewStrip">
                            {% if already_reviewed and my_review %}
                                <div class="bd-review-done">
                                    <i data-lucide="badge-check"></i>
                                    <span>You rated this stay <strong>{{ my_review.rating }}/5</strong>{% if my_review.date %} · {{ my_review.date }}{% endif %}</span>
                                    <a href="/reviews">VIEW MY REVIEWS</a>
                                </div>
                            {% elseif show_review %}
                                <button type="button" class="bd-btn-amber" id="bdReviewOpen">
                                    <i data-lucide="star"></i> RATE YOUR STAY
                                </button>
                                <span class="bd-review-hint">Your stars + words go on {{ host_name }}'s profile and your Reviews page.</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}

                </section>

                <!-- ==============================================
                     CARD 2 — payment summary
                =============================================== -->
                <section class="up-card bd-paycard up-reveal">

                    <div class="bd-pay-header">
                        <h3>Payment Summary</h3>
                        <a class="bd-pay-history" href="/payments">Payment History</a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bd-row">
                        <span class="bd-row-label">Booking Total</span>
                        <span class="bd-row-value">₱ {{ b.total_fmt }}</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bd-divider-dotted"></div>

                    <div class="bd-row">
                        <span class="bd-row-label bd-row-muted">Amount Paid</span>
                        <span class="bd-row-value bd-row-medium">₱ {{ b.paid_fmt }}</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bd-progress">
                        <div class="bd-progress-track">
                            <div class="bd-progress-fill" style="width: {{ b.pct }}%;"></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="bd-progress-caption">{{ b.pct }}% of the booking is paid</p>
                    </div>

                    {% if b.show_refund %}
                        <div class="bd-row">
                            <span class="bd-row-label bd-row-muted">Refunded to Wallet</span>
                            <span class="bd-row-value bd-refund-amount">₱ {{ b.refunded_fmt }}</span>
                        </div>
                    {% elseif b.pay_state != 'full' %}
                        <div class="bd-row">
                            <span class="bd-row-label">Remaining Balance</span>
                            <span class="bd-remaining-value">₱ {{ b.left_fmt }}</span>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}

                    <div class="bd-actions">
                        {% if b.show_pay %}
                            <a class="bd-btn-dark" href="/listings/{{ b.listing_id }}/payment?pay_balance={{ b.id }}">PAY BALANCE ₱{{ b.left_fmt }}</a>
                        {% endif %}
                        <a class="bd-btn-amber" href="/bookings">BACK TO MY BOOKINGS</a>

                        {% if b.show_cancel %}
                            {% set cancel_confirm = b.status == 'confirmed'
                                ? 'WARNING: Cancel this CONFIRMED booking? What you paid will be refunded to your wallet (2% platform fee) and the host will be notified. This cannot be undone.'
                                : 'WARNING: Cancel this booking? Your paid reserve will be refunded to your wallet (2% platform fee) and the host will be notified. This cannot be undone.' %}
                            <form
                                class="bd-cancel-form"
                                method="post"
                                action="/booking/cancel-booking"
                                onsubmit="return confirm('{{ cancel_confirm }}');"
                            >
                                <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ b.id }}">
                                <button type="submit" class="bd-btn-red">CANCEL MY BOOKING</button>
                            </form>
                            <span class="bd-cancel-warning">(!) Cannot be undone - 98% of what you paid goes back to your wallet</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                </section>

            </div>
        </main>

        {{ include('partials/footer.html.twig') }}

        <!-- ==============================================
             REVIEW BOX — "rate your stay" overlay.
             Auto-opens when review_open=1 (just cancelled via
             ?review=1, or a completed stay not yet dismissed).
             X / backdrop / ESC / "Not now" skip it (remembered via
             POST /reviews/dismiss); the amber RATE YOUR STAY button
             in Card 1 re-opens it any time. Submit POSTs
             /reviews/submit and flips the strip to the done-row.
        =============================================== -->
        {% if show_review or already_reviewed %}
        <div class="bd-review-overlay" id="bdReviewOverlay"
             role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="bdReviewTitle"
             data-booking-id="{{ b.id }}"
             data-open="{{ review_open ? '1' : '0' }}">
            <div class="bd-review-modal">
                <button type="button" class="bd-review-close" id="bdReviewClose" aria-label="Close — maybe later" title="Close">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"/><path d="m6 6 12 12"/></svg>
                </button>

                <div class="bd-review-form" id="bdReviewForm">
                    <p class="bd-review-kicker">Booking #{{ b.id }}</p>
                    <h3 class="bd-review-title" id="bdReviewTitle">Rate your stay</h3>
                    <p class="bd-review-sub">How was “{{ listing_title }}”? Tap the stars — your rating and words land on {{ host_name }}'s profile and your Reviews page.</p>

                    <div class="bd-review-stars" id="bdReviewStars">
                        {% for i in 1..5 %}
                            <button type="button" class="bd-star" data-value="{{ i }}" aria-label="Rate {{ i }} star{{ i > 1 ? 's' : '' }}" title="{{ i }} star{{ i > 1 ? 's' : '' }}">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
                            </button>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                    <p class="bd-review-star-label" id="bdReviewStarLabel">Tap a star to rate</p>

                    <textarea class="bd-review-comment" id="bdReviewComment" maxlength="1000"
                              placeholder="Tell others about your stay — what made it great, what could be better (optional)"></textarea>

                    <div class="bd-review-actions">
                        <button type="button" class="bd-review-skip" id="bdReviewSkip">Not now</button>
                        <button type="button" class="bd-review-submit" id="bdReviewSubmit" disabled>Submit review</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="bd-review-error" id="bdReviewError" hidden></p>
                </div>

                <div class="bd-review-thanks" id="bdReviewThanks" hidden>
                    <i data-lucide="check-circle"></i>
                    <h4>Thanks for the review!</h4>
                    <p id="bdReviewThanksMsg">Your stars are now on the host's profile and your My Reviews page.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        <!-- Lucide — guarded loader, same key as navbar (never double-runs) -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";
                function renderRhIcons() {
                    if (window.lucide && typeof window.lucide.createIcons === "function") {
                        window.lucide.createIcons();
                    }
                }
                if (!window.__rhNavbarLucide) {
                    window.__rhNavbarLucide = true;
                    var s = document.createElement("script");
                    s.src = "https://unpkg.com/lucide@0.469.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js";
                    s.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
                    document.head.appendChild(s);
                }
                if (document.readyState === "loading") {
                    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", renderRhIcons);
                } else {
                    renderRhIcons();
                }
                window.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Sidebar collapse — same behavior + localStorage key as legacy -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                var sidebar = document.getElementById("upSidebar");
                var toggle = document.getElementById("upSidebarToggle");
                if (!sidebar || !toggle) {
                    return;
                }

                var STORAGE_KEY = "roomhive_sidebar_collapsed";
                var links = sidebar.querySelectorAll(".up-side-link");

                function updateTitles(collapsed) {
                    links.forEach(function (link) {
                        var label = link.querySelector(".up-side-label");
                        if (collapsed) {
                            link.setAttribute("title", label ? label.textContent : "");
                        } else {
                            link.removeAttribute("title");
                        }
                    });
                }

                function applyState(collapsed) {
                    sidebar.classList.toggle("collapsed", collapsed);
                    toggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", collapsed ? "false" : "true");
                    toggle.setAttribute(
                        "aria-label",
                        collapsed ? "Expand sidebar" : "Collapse sidebar",
                    );
                    updateTitles(collapsed);
                }

                var savedCollapsed = false;
                try {
                    savedCollapsed = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) === "1";
                } catch (e) {}
                applyState(savedCollapsed);

                toggle.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    var nowCollapsed = !sidebar.classList.contains("collapsed");
                    applyState(nowCollapsed);
                    try {
                        localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, nowCollapsed ? "1" : "0");
                    } catch (e) {}
                });
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Reveal — the REAL legacy mechanism: myaccount.css waits for .in-view.
     Plus a 1.5s failsafe so the page can never render blank. -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";

                var reduced = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
                var revealEls = Array.prototype.slice.call(
                    document.querySelectorAll(".up-reveal"),
                );

                function showAll() {
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        el.classList.add("in-view");
                    });
                }

                if (reduced || !("IntersectionObserver" in window)) {
                    showAll();
                } else {
                    var io = new IntersectionObserver(
                        function (entries) {
                            entries.forEach(function (entry) {
                                if (!entry.isIntersecting) {
                                    return;
                                }
                                var el = entry.target;
                                io.unobserve(el);
                                el.classList.add("in-view");
                                window.setTimeout(function () {
                                    el.style.setProperty("--i", "0");
                                }, 1200);
                            });
                        },
                        {
                            threshold: 0.12,
                            rootMargin: "0px 0px -40px 0px",
                        },
                    );
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        io.observe(el);
                    });

                    /* failsafe — force-reveal anything still hidden after 1.5s */
                    setTimeout(showAll, 1500);
                }
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Wishlist heart — glow = saved, un-glow = removed.
             Same /wishlist/toggle endpoint the My Wishlist page uses;
             accepts both response shapes ({ok, added} / {ok, saved}).
             Optimistic UI: glow flips instantly, then snaps to the
             server's answer (reverts if the server says not-ok). -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";

                var heart = document.getElementById("bdWishlistHeart");
                if (!heart) {
                    return;
                }

                var listingId = heart.getAttribute("data-listing-id");
                if (!listingId || listingId === "0") {
                    return;
                }

                var busy = false;
                var popTimer = null;

                function setGlow(on) {
                    heart.classList.toggle("is-active", !!on);
                    heart.setAttribute("aria-pressed", on ? "true" : "false");
                    heart.setAttribute(
                        "aria-label",
                        on ? "Remove from wishlist" : "Save to wishlist"
                    );
                    heart.title = on ? "Remove from wishlist" : "Save to wishlist";
                }

                function pop() {
                    heart.classList.remove("is-popping");
                    void heart.offsetWidth; /* restart the pop animation */
                    heart.classList.add("is-popping");
                    if (popTimer) {
                        window.clearTimeout(popTimer);
                    }
                    popTimer = window.setTimeout(function () {
                        heart.classList.remove("is-popping");
                    }, 450);
                }

                heart.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    if (busy) {
                        return;
                    }
                    busy = true;

                    var wasOn = heart.classList.contains("is-active");

                    /* optimistic glow first — the click must feel instant */
                    setGlow(!wasOn);
                    pop();

                    fetch("/wishlist/toggle", {
                        method: "POST",
                        headers: {
                            "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                        },
                        body: "listing_id=" + encodeURIComponent(listingId),
                    })
                        .then(function (r) {
                            return r.json();
                        })
                        .then(function (d) {
                            if (!d || !d.ok) {
                                /* login expired / bad request — fall back
                                   to the pre-click state */
                                setGlow(wasOn);
                                return;
                            }
                            /* both controller shapes: {ok, added} and {ok, saved} */
                            var on = d.added !== undefined ? !!d.added : !!d.saved;
                            setGlow(on);
                        })
                        .catch(function () {
                            /* network error / endpoint missing — keep the
                               visual toggle so the page still behaves */
                        })
                        .then(function () {
                            busy = false;
                        });
                });
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Review box — 5 clickable stars (upper) + comment (lower).
             X / backdrop / ESC / "Not now" skip it (fire-and-forget
             POST /reviews/dismiss so a completed stay is never nagged
             twice). Submit POSTs /reviews/submit; success swaps in the
             thanks panel, then the strip flips to the green done-row. -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";

                var overlay = document.getElementById("bdReviewOverlay");
                if (!overlay) {
                    return;
                }

                var bookingId = overlay.getAttribute("data-booking-id") || "0";
                if (!bookingId || bookingId === "0") {
                    return;
                }
                var autoOpen = overlay.getAttribute("data-open") === "1";

                var form      = document.getElementById("bdReviewForm");
                var starsBox  = document.getElementById("bdReviewStars");
                var starLabel = document.getElementById("bdReviewStarLabel");
                var commentEl = document.getElementById("bdReviewComment");
                var submitBtn = document.getElementById("bdReviewSubmit");
                var skipBtn   = document.getElementById("bdReviewSkip");
                var closeBtn  = document.getElementById("bdReviewClose");
                var errorEl   = document.getElementById("bdReviewError");
                var thanksEl  = document.getElementById("bdReviewThanks");
                var thanksMsg = document.getElementById("bdReviewThanksMsg");
                var strip     = document.getElementById("bdReviewStrip");

                var LABELS = ["", "Terrible", "Poor", "Okay", "Good", "Excellent"];
                var selected  = 0;
                var submitted = false;
                var busy      = false;

                function renderIcons() {
                    if (window.lucide && typeof window.lucide.createIcons === "function") {
                        window.lucide.createIcons();
                    }
                }

                function paintStars(count) {
                    starsBox.querySelectorAll(".bd-star").forEach(function (st) {
                        var v = parseInt(st.getAttribute("data-value"), 10);
                        st.classList.toggle("is-lit", v <= count);
                    });
                }

                function setLabel(n) {
                    if (n > 0) {
                        starLabel.textContent = n + " star" + (n > 1 ? "s" : "") + " — " + LABELS[n];
                        starLabel.classList.add("has-value");
                    } else {
                        starLabel.textContent = "Tap a star to rate";
                        starLabel.classList.remove("has-value");
                    }
                }

                starsBox.querySelectorAll(".bd-star").forEach(function (st) {
                    var v = parseInt(st.getAttribute("data-value"), 10);

                    st.addEventListener("mouseenter", function () {
                        paintStars(v);
                        setLabel(v);
                    });
                    st.addEventListener("mouseleave", function () {
                        paintStars(selected);
                        setLabel(selected);
                    });
                    st.addEventListener("click", function () {
                        selected = v;
                        paintStars(selected);
                        setLabel(selected);
                        submitBtn.disabled = false;
                    });
                });

                function openBox() {
                    overlay.classList.add("is-open");
                    document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";
                }

                function closeBox(remember) {
                    overlay.classList.remove("is-open");
                    document.body.style.overflow = "";

                    /* X / Not now → remember the skip server-side so a
                       completed stay never auto-pops twice (fire and
                       forget — the page keeps working either way). */
                    if (remember && !submitted) {
                        try {
                            fetch("/reviews/dismiss", {
                                method: "POST",
                                headers: {
                                    "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                                },
                                body: "booking_id=" + encodeURIComponent(bookingId),
                            }).catch(function () {});
                        } catch (e) {}
                    }
                }

                overlay.addEventListener("click", function (ev) {
                    if (ev.target === overlay) {
                        closeBox(true);
                    }
                });
                document.addEventListener("keydown", function (ev) {
                    if (ev.key === "Escape" && overlay.classList.contains("is-open")) {
                        closeBox(true);
                    }
                });
                closeBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    closeBox(true);
                });
                skipBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    closeBox(true);
                });

                /* the amber strip button re-opens the box any time */
                var stripBtn = document.getElementById("bdReviewOpen");
                if (stripBtn) {
                    stripBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                        submitted = false;    /* a fresh attempt …   */
                        form.hidden = false;  /* …shows the form     */
                        thanksEl.hidden = true;
                        errorEl.hidden = true;
                        openBox();
                    });
                }

                submitBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    if (busy || selected < 1) {
                        return;
                    }
                    busy = true;
                    errorEl.hidden = true;
                    submitBtn.textContent = "SUBMITTING\u2026";

                    var body = "booking_id=" + encodeURIComponent(bookingId)
                             + "&rating=" + encodeURIComponent(selected)
                             + "&comment=" + encodeURIComponent(commentEl.value);

                    fetch("/reviews/submit", {
                        method: "POST",
                        headers: {
                            "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                        },
                        body: body,
                    })
                        .then(function (r) {
                            return r.json();
                        })
                        .then(function (d) {
                            if (!d || !d.success) {
                                errorEl.textContent = (d && d.message) || "Could not save your review. Please try again.";
                                errorEl.hidden = false;
                                submitBtn.textContent = "SUBMIT REVIEW";
                                busy = false;
                                return;
                            }

                            submitted = true;

                            /* thanks panel */
                            thanksMsg.textContent = (d.message || "Your stars are now on the host's profile and your My Reviews page.");
                            form.hidden = true;
                            thanksEl.hidden = false;
                            renderIcons();

                            /* the strip flips to the green done-row */
                            if (strip) {
                                strip.innerHTML =
                                    '<div class="bd-review-done">' +
                                    '<i data-lucide="badge-check"></i>' +
                                    '<span>You rated this stay <strong>' + selected + '/5</strong></span>' +
                                    '<a href="/reviews">VIEW MY REVIEWS</a>' +
                                    '</div>';
                                renderIcons();
                            }

                            window.setTimeout(function () {
                                closeBox(false);
                            }, 2000);
                            busy = false;
                        })
                        .catch(function () {
                            errorEl.textContent = "Network error — please try again.";
                            errorEl.hidden = false;
                            submitBtn.textContent = "SUBMIT REVIEW";
                            busy = false;
                        });
                });

                if (autoOpen) {
                    /* let the page reveal play first, then pop the box */
                    window.setTimeout(openBox, 450);
                }
            })();
        </script>

    </body>
</html>
